<p>Australia announced a senior military leadership reshuffle on Monday, naming Vice Admiral Mark Hammond as the next chief of the Australian Defence Force and Lieutenant General Susan Coyle as the next chief of army. Prime Minister Anthony Albanese said Hammond, the current navy chief, would replace David Johnston, who has served as defence force chief since July 2024, while Coyle will take over the army role in July from Lieutenant General Simon Stuart. The changes stand out both for continuity and for symbolism. Hammond brings roughly 40 years of Royal Australian Navy experience and has overseen work on the AUKUS nuclear-submarine program as navy chief. Coyle, currently chief of joint capabilities, will become the first woman to lead the Australian army, a milestone described as historic across multiple reports. The appointments come as Australia continues broader defence planning and, according to one report, seeks to raise the number of women in uniform while facing scrutiny over allegations of misconduct within the military.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/GTutV9SbaTBb8g-mVDkefbHpBMdD-I34gSTzr2SbUI_jDQlm5IuE8lj-u7f4CmQc8Y9pTC69P8vzbnBY2DYkoavFuYz7W6_6uPSrKTH-Slffe2zqopXFXuNjX1ljAUxQsqor6MhuS8Z_p9mvr-_qkM6-RY8LcQGegv4aM-IGJRSknzHADkKtcM4HpKBegTD8bceSc4uXnoTkAtnPDWq4dgppFj7U7BjgAUCadOR2APqKQrM98OxQK_PCnhVtt2xHezI' alt='Australia announced a defence leadership reshuffle that includes Lieutenant General Susan Coyle becoming the first woman to lead the army.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Career start: Hammond joined the navy in 1986 as an electronics technician and became a naval officer two years later.</li><li>Submarine background: During his career, Hammond served on Australia&#x27;s Collins-class submarines.</li><li>Service record: The Guardian described Coyle as an officer with more than three decades of service before her promotion.</li></ul><blockquote>Vice Admiral Hammond has had a distinguished career spanning 40 years in the Royal Australian Navy - Anthony Albanese</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Anthony Albanese: The prime minister presented Hammond&#x27;s selection as an experience-driven choice that would carry navy leadership insight into the chief of the Defence Force role. (<a href='https://michaelwest.com.au/navy-boss-named-next-defence-force-chief/'>Michael West Media</a>)</li><li>The Guardian: The outlet cast Coyle&#x27;s elevation as a &#x27;deeply historic moment&#x27;, stressing the symbolic significance of a woman reaching the army&#x27;s top job. (<a href='https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/apr/13/susan-coyle-chief-of-army-australia'>The Guardian</a>)</li><li>South China Morning Post: SCMP connected the reshuffle to wider questions about representation and military culture inside Australia&#x27;s armed forces. (<a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/asia/australasia/article/3349850/australia-appoints-first-female-army-chief-historic-reshuffle-military-top-brass'>South China Morning Post</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://michaelwest.com.au/navy-boss-named-next-defence-force-chief/'>Navy boss named next defence force chief</a> - michaelwest.com.au</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/apr/13/susan-coyle-chief-of-army-australia'>Susan Coyle to be first woman to lead Australian army in ‘deeply historic moment’</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/asia/australasia/article/3349850/australia-appoints-first-female-army-chief-historic-reshuffle-military-top-brass'>Australia appoints first female army chief in ‘historic’ reshuffle of military top brass</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/australia-appoints-lt-gen-susan-coyle-as-first-woman-to-lead-its-army/article70856382.ece'>Australia appoints Lt. Gen. Susan Coyle as first woman to lead its Army</a> - thehindu.com</li></ul>